1
00:00:03,095 --> 00:00:05,017
Way up high, above the Earth,

2
00:00:05,067 --> 00:00:07,737
Noah and Mila are floating inside Curio!

3
00:00:07,787 --> 00:00:08,332
But why?

4
00:00:09,145 --> 00:00:12,136
Mila lets go of her pencil: it doesn't fall!

5
00:00:12,186 --> 00:00:15,088
So, in space, is there no gravity anymore?

6
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:17,386
Discovery mission!

7
00:00:19,902 --> 00:00:20,523
Mini mode!

8
00:00:20,573 --> 00:00:22,269
A box, with a ball inside.

9
00:00:22,319 --> 00:00:24,821
I let go of everything: the box falls,

10
00:00:24,871 --> 00:00:27,911
and the ball falls with it, at the same speed.

11
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:28,918
Inside the box…

12
00:00:28,968 --> 00:00:30,043
the ball floats!

13
00:00:30,812 --> 00:00:33,476
Throw a ball: it falls to the ground.

14
00:00:33,526 --> 00:00:35,237
Harder: it goes further.

15
00:00:35,287 --> 00:00:36,044
Super hard?

16
00:00:36,094 --> 00:00:37,144
It still falls…

17
00:00:37,194 --> 00:00:40,421
but it misses the Earth, and goes around it!

18
00:00:41,201 --> 00:00:42,116
That's an orbit!

19
00:00:42,166 --> 00:00:45,914
Curio goes so fast that it keeps falling and missing the Earth,

20
00:00:45,964 --> 00:00:46,758
over and over.

21
00:00:46,808 --> 00:00:48,386
Noah and Mila fall with it…

22
00:00:48,436 --> 00:00:49,280
so they float!

23
00:00:50,201 --> 00:00:52,048
Real astronauts are the same:

24
00:00:52,098 --> 00:00:54,468
their station falls around the Earth.

25
00:00:54,518 --> 00:00:55,319
And up there,

26
00:00:55,369 --> 00:00:57,723
gravity is almost as strong as here!

27
00:00:58,504 --> 00:01:00,684
That's why astronauts float.

28
00:01:02,001 --> 00:01:04,827
Astronauts float because they fall around the Earth,

29
00:01:04,877 --> 00:01:06,259
without ever reaching it.

30
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:09,494
With an adult: jump off a small step.

31
00:01:09,544 --> 00:01:12,942
During the fall, your body doesn't feel its weight.

32
00:01:12,992 --> 00:01:14,817
One second as an astronaut!

33
00:01:15,611 --> 00:01:17,846
And why does the Moon change shape?

34
00:01:17,896 --> 00:01:19,202
The answer tomorrow.
